            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ModernTex 1.0.0</h2>
<p>First release. A native macOS LaTeX editor for researchers: multi-file manuscript navigation, synchronized PDF preview, BibTeX completion by author or title, plain-language compile diagnostics, anonymized submission export, and reference checks. Requires macOS 14 or later and a TeX distribution such as MacTeX or TinyTeX.</p>
]]></description>
